 g of mixology magic at The 519. We had so much fun last year at our Pride 
 Sober Mixology Class with Gail Lynch of @zero_cocktailbar that we’re doi
 ng it again! Tuesday\, June 2 from 6 to 9 pm\, our expert mixologist will 
 guide you in the art of crafting delicious and Instagram-worthy drinks\, a
 ll alcohol free. This class is $25 per person\, and is a great way for the
  sober or sober-curious to start Pride month with a bang. Get tickets at T
 he519.org/Mixology Questions? Contact Aeryn at APfaff@The519.org [image de
 scription: A photo of Gail Lynch in front of a stylized image of cocktails
  and fruit.] ‍
