BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fresh Hot Pride - Ft. Toronto&#x27\;s Best Newer 2SLGBTQIA+ Comics
 !
DTSTART:20260604T200000
DTEND:20260604T200000
UID:d549850db97a70735a2af02a98a5ad18@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A very special all-queer Pride edition of Toronto&#x27\;s sign
 ature comedy show featuring newer comedians anchored by 2 pros! Toronto! C
 ome kick off your Pride month by supporting hilarious\, up and coming 2SLG
 BTQIA+ comedians! This very special show features 5 queer comedians in the
 ir first few years in the industry anchored by 2 professional headliners. 
 Fresh Hot Pride is a fun\, inclusive\, comfortable live comedy experience 
 for the girls\, gays\, and theys both in the audience and on stage. Come a
 nd enjoy a fun night of comedy and carry on with your Pride celebrations f
 eeling like your most amazing (slightly lit!) selves\, or be home in bed b
 y 10 if that&#x27\;s your vibe! 🔥🌈 Doors 7 45 pm\, show 8 pm! Ticket
 s are $15 but all are welcome regardless of means - DM @annasebastiencomed
 y on Instagram for Pay What You Can tickets. This show is a special editio
 n of Fresh Hot Babes (ft. newer femme and queer comics) which takes place 
 the first and third Thursday of each and every month at Tallboys! Come min
 gle and giggle with fellow queer cutie comedy lovers! Full line up announc
 ement coming soon diva! ---- The venue: The show takes place in the theatr
 e space in the downstairs area of Tallboys. Take a left when you walk in a
 nd head downstairs! The venue unfortunately has a few barriers to access. 
 There is a large step to enter the main bar area. The theatre space and wa
 shrooms are located down a staircase\, with tight corners from the bottom 
 landing to the theatre. There is also a single step from the basement hall
 way into the venue room. Once inside\, there is no grade change. There is 
 a communal gender neutral washroom with urinals and toilets\, a singe stal
 l unmarked gender neutral washroom with a toilet\, and a woman&#x27\;s was
 hroom with toilets. Seating is self-assigned and the venue is intimate\, s
 o we recommend groups arrive early so they can grab seats together Communi
 ty: All are welcome at this event\, including allies\, that recognize this
  is a queer space where we are inclusive and respectful of one another\, a
 nd where oppressive behaviour won&#x27\;t fly At this show we only speak t
 o our own identities\, we don&#x27\;t punch down\, and isms\, phobias\, an
 d aggressive crowd work will never be tolerated. The show is hosted and pr
 oduced by a queer\, nonbinary comedian who takes this seriously AF\, and a
 ll the comedians agree to community guidelines. This show will be fun fill
 ed and full of friendly queers\, and the audience and comedian can make ne
 w friends and mix and mingle afterwards. If you are flying solo\, are nerv
 ous\, or have any questions\, feel free to DM the host @annasebastiencomed
 y on Instagram. This is all about community! We all want a sexy\, healthy 
 time! If you are feeling sick\, please stay home! Refund requests will be 
 honoured up to 12 hours before the show. You are totally welcome to wear a
  mask\, and we&#x27\;d be stoked if you rapid tested before the show. ‍
LOCATION:Tallboys Craft Beer House\, 838 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/fresh-hot-pride---ft-torontos-best-newer-2
 slgbtqia-comics
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
