BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lez Beach
DTSTART:20260605T110000
DTEND:20260605T110000
UID:01a96f3b322b8ebde87f08184a43dfc4@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Time to defrost lesbians\, dykes\, and sapphics\, Lez Beach is
  back. And once again\, we’re starting Pride month with a sapphic splash
  🧑🏻‍❤️‍💋‍🧑🏽🌊☀️This year\, we have some ext
 ra special gifts for our attendees! More details below⬇️ The Waterfron
 t BIA has kindly offered us 50 ferry tickets. Our volunteers and us will b
 e posted outside the ferry docs on the left-hand side. We’ll be handing 
 out tickets till they run out. First-come\, first-served! Thank you\, @wat
 erfrontbia!! More info to come on this. Steph from Sapphics Aquatica @insi
 deoasis231 will be at our table\, handing out discounted tickets to their 
 event on July 27. Rumour has it a collab is coming… 🤫This discount is
  one per person and reserved for our Lez Beach goers !! Be sure to say hi!
  At our table\, we’ll be offering some @trans_tape supplies as well - fr
 ee of charge. Just ask\, and we can help apply or give some strips. We are
  happy to announce that we will be having artists come show and sell their
  art (left side of the Mermaid Cafe). We will be following up with another
  post on more details and who these amazing artists are! We want to give a
  big\, warm thank you to our sponsor\, @allkindsclub. All Kinds Club Couns
 elling is a queer- and trans-centered virtual therapy practice based in On
 tario\, offering affirming\, trauma-informed support for 2SLGBTQIA+ indivi
 duals and couples/relationships navigating identity\, relational dynamics\
 , mental health\, and life transitions. We want to take a moment to thank 
 our community for their donations. We truly appreciate and are thankful fo
 r this trust and support! Special thanks to our artists: Main poster desig
 n: urfavouriteloser Sticker #1: @emini.aduke Sticker #2: @mossedmars Stick
 er #3: @kaitlyn__victoria Sticker #4: @alisha.jjpg Lez Beach is first and 
 foremost a grassroots gathering to combat rising levels of harassment and 
 exclusion towards lesbians in queer spaces. Hanlan’s Point Beach is a pu
 blic\, clothing optional space and we cannot control who can and who canno
 t enter the space during Lez Beach. If you have concerns about the crowd\,
  please come sit with us at the entrance to the event! We keep each other 
 safe. ‍
LOCATION:Hanlan&#x27\;s Point Beach\, Toronto Islands
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/lez-beach-4
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
