 ment dedicated to the soul\, the heat\, and the unmistakable rhythm of Cal
 i\, Colombia. 🦜💃 Known as La Sucursal del Cielo (The Branch of Heave
 n)\, Cali’s spirit is defined by a passion for the dance floor that we a
 re bringing straight to the 6ix! 🥥☀️ From the timeless swing of Sal
 sa and Merengue to the high-energy pulse of Reggaeton\, Dancehall and Trib
 al House\, we are transforming the night into a tropical sanctuary. 🍍
