DESCRIPTION:Hello and welcome to the Extravaganza! A queer inclusive game 
 night in Toronto. Powered by Changeling Gaming About Us: Our events are fr
 iendly meetups that aim to create a safe space for the 2SLGBTQIA+ communit
 y\, friends\, and allies to gather and connect through gaming. Our goals f
 or our events are to foster greater community\, help build friendships\, a
 nd support our community&#x27\;s safe space partners. Age recommendation\,
  16 years+ What to Expect: Connecting with you and helping you find a grou
 p and a game is literally why we love putting these events on. Should you 
 join us\, both our volunteers and veteran attendees will help you feel com
 fortable and at home. Whether you&#x27\;re a seasoned gamer or new to the 
 world of board games\, this event offers something for everyone. Discover 
 new games\, challenge your friends\, and make new connections with fellow 
 board game lovers along the way. Come as a group or solo\, and our friendl
 y volunteers can help pair you with a community table\, assist with introd
 uctions\, and offer support with any new games by providing a teach of the
  rules. Extravaganza events are community first. However you identify on t
 he 2SLGBTQIA+ spectrum\, there is always a chair for you at our game table
 s. Friendly allies are also welcome\, so long as they are respectful of th
 e intentions of the event space. ‍
