SUMMARY:Les Femmes Fatales present Vivacious Vixens!
DTSTART:20260619T193000
DTEND:20260619T193000
UID:fa001f1c15ae6aa61905fccdb942a316@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:It&#x27\;s time for unruly women and femmes to bring our joy\,
  fierceness and glamour magick to the stage. Get ready for big cleavage bi
 g hair and bigger attitudes. And all of the glamour and grit. It&#x27\;s t
