BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ubuntu Pride Picnic in the Park
DTSTART:20260621T110000
DTEND:20260621T110000
UID:023e23c3623356caa8b0744da0ab3159@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Ubuntu Pride Picnic at Christie Pits Afrobeats\, potluck &amp\
 ; community for queer women\, trans &amp\; non-binary folks. 20% supports 
 UPLift Black. Afrobeats • Joy • Community • Connection Presented by 
 Teatime with Tammie + Her City Toronto Celebrate Pride the Ubuntu way — 
 “I am because we are.” Join us at Christie Pits Park for an uplifting 
 afternoon rooted in Ubuntu — “I am because we are.” This gathering i
 s a joyful space for queer women\, trans women\, and non-binary folks to c
 onnect\, celebrate our differences\, and feel held by community. Let’s g
 ather picnic-style under the sun and celebrate who we are — together. Wh
 at to Expect Warm welcome + relaxed meet-and-greet vibes A high-energy Afr
 obeats welcome dance to kick things off Women-led Djembe drumming circle Y
 outh dance &amp\; spoken word performance Potluck-style picnic (bring some
 thing to share if you can) Group games + fun prizes Ubuntu activity statio
 ns: Butterfly message wall “Where We’re From” community pins Connect
 ion activities A Butterfly Flurry Pride photo moment (Ubuntu-themed photo 
 booth vibes!) Your Ticket Gives Back $10 of every ticket will be donated t
 o UPlift Black’s Newcomer Program\, a BIPOC 2SLGBTQI+ led nonprofit work
 ing to dismantle systemic barriers and build community for marginalized pe
 ople. Your ticket helps fund: LGBTQI+ newcomer peer support Settlement nav
 igation Community newcomer nights Refugee support letters Want to contribu
 te more? 👉 https://www.upliftblack.org/donations When we gather\, we gi
 ve back. Pass it on community ticket Community Ticket Option: You can purc
 hase an extra ticket to pass along to someone in the community who may not
  be able to afford it. A small act that helps keep this space accessible f
 or everyone. Tickets are limited. Come dance\, connect\, and celebrate Ubu
 ntu Pride with us. Because we are stronger — together. Highlights from P
 ride Love Train Dance Picnic 2025 We are offering a 2-for-1 community deal
  for $45. 20% of ticket proceeds go to the nonprofit\, UPLift Black.
LOCATION:Christie Pits Park\, 750 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/ubuntu-pride-picnic-in-the-park
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
